<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has stepped up strikes in southern Lebanon, hitting Qantara, causing an explosion in Khiam and flying drones over Beirut, while an overflight wounded a Lebanese footballer. The Lebanese army seized a large weapons cache in a Beirut suburb warehouse and another depot in the city’s southern suburbs. Hezbollah arrested five members in Batroun, continued artillery fire on Israeli positions and began cash payments to war victims and displaced families. UNRWA funding cuts have deepened hardship for Palestinian refugees in Lebanon. The conflict has caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOSzBYVTZaWEE5UlVZVlFscjNtUkFERXhGcEtUdEdSN2V6THd6cGszaHVxNUgzT2RxcGNWU296VS16T2Q1Q0ltWUt0eDBfVTRaMW5WdWVBY0RRYnlVZFg4RnotVkFKODhOUTBMMUJSY2V3UGFibVpCci1qNk5qdHk5QTVNb0JUbHlJenI1NG9KMEpYWUNZX1gzMjY2dk8xT1NLTk82Smh1Z3lQalp6bDlpOF9UdGptU3JhUnZtSUQ3aHl1cHFN?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPdzVILXVQb1pXa053QmhuN0NQSjRRcEZRMjV1dGZBTXp3VWRSOG1wMlFnTjlfaFVxN0dqTllrUjhmbUs3MEY1ZktaZE9EUUg1cHQ0Z0ZwMDFyUHc4S1REdTRYUzR4bDJrbnFfQnRzZlRxR2txRUJXSGlhYlBTdG5JeGlIUlk5WEd4bDBWcy1mVzNlaGVyT1dtVVFTNjJ3NDk1SVNHSXkzVXBHN3BNMU1QWnJR?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
